                        </div>
                        <div id="fws_5ef418ba77452" data-column-margin="default" data-midnight="dark" class="wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row standard_section " style="padding-top: 75px; padding-bottom: 75px; ">
                           <div class="row-bg-wrap" data-bg-animation="none" data-bg-overlay="false">
                              <div class="inner-wrap">
                                 <div class="row-bg" style=""></div>
                              </div>
                              <div class="row-bg-overlay"></div>
                           </div>
                           <div class="row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left">
                              <div class="vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-offset-2 vc_col-lg-8 vc_col-md-offset-1 vc_col-md-10 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone " data-t-w-inherits="default" data-bg-cover="" data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-hover-bg="" data-hover-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0">
                                 <div class="vc_column-inner">
                                    <div class="column-bg-overlay-wrap" data-bg-animation="none">
                                       <div class="column-bg-overlay"></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="wpb_wrapper">
                                       <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
                                          <div class="wpb_wrapper">
                                             <h2 class="center purple bold fs34">How I Turned My Hobby into a Successful 7-Figure Business</h2>
                                          </div>
                                       </div>
                                       <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
                                          <div class="wpb_wrapper">
                                             <p>I started Biddy Tarot way back in 1999 when flashing banner ads were all the rage. At the time, I was studying business and commerce at University, and in my breaks, I was learning everything I could about Tarot and then posting it to my website—Tarot card meanings and spreads, techniques, you name it. That's how Biddy Tarot was born.</p>
                                             <p>After I graduated, I went on to work in some of Australia's largest companies as a management consultant and human resource strategist, quickly climbing the corporate ladder and building a successful career. For 15 years, I worked my corporate job and read Tarot on the side.</p>
                                             <p>But over the years, I had a growing sense that staying in my corporate job wasn’t my life path. By the time my second daughter was born in 2011, my gut – and my Tarot cards – was telling me it was time to leave the corporate world and focus on Biddy Tarot full time. So, on September 20, 2012, I took the leap!</p>
                                             <p>I didn’t realise it then, but this fun side-hobby would later turn into the 7-figure business people now know as Biddy Tarot.</p>
                                          </div>
                                       </div>
                                    </div>
                                 </div>
                              </div>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                        <div id="fws_5ef418ba779e7" data-column-margin="default" data-midnight="light" class="wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-section standard_section " style="padding-top: 100px; padding-bottom: 100px; ">
                           <div class="row-bg-wrap" data-bg-animation="none" data-bg-overlay="false">
                              <div class="inner-wrap using-image">
                                 <div class="row-bg using-image" style="background-image: url(https://www.biddytarot.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/About_BG-4.jpg); background-position: center center; background-repeat: no-repeat; "></div>
                              </div>
                              <div class="row-bg-overlay"></div>
                           </div>
                           <div class="row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 light left">
                              <div style=" color: #ffffff;" class="vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-offset-3 vc_col-lg-6 vc_col-md-offset-2 vc_col-md-8 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone " data-t-w-inherits="default" data-bg-cover="" data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-hover-bg="" data-hover-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0">
                                 <div class="vc_column-inner">
                                    <div class="column-bg-overlay-wrap" data-bg-animation="none">
                                       <div class="column-bg-overlay"></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="wpb_wrapper">
                                       <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
                                          <div class="wpb_wrapper">
                                             <p style="text-align: center;"><span class="white bold fs34">Why &#8220;Biddy&#8221; Tarot?</span></p>
                                          </div>
                                       </div>
                                       <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
                                          <div class="wpb_wrapper">
                                             <p>Many people ask me, “What does the ‘Biddy’ mean?” Well, I wish I had an impressive story to tell you about how I meditated in the rainforest about my business name and dreamed of a cute, furry kangaroo that whispered the words, “Biddy Tarot.”</p>
                                             <p>But alas, it wouldn’t be the truth.</p>
                                             <p>In fact, the truth is a little embarrassing.</p>
                                             <p>When I was thirteen, <em>all</em> my friends had cool nicknames—except me.</p>
                                             <p>So, I did what any kid would do: I made up my own nickname—Biddy (short for Brigit)—and encouraged everyone to call me by it.</p>
                                             <p>The only problem was . . . my plan didn’t work.</p>
                                             <p>Everyone kept calling me Brigit, much to my disappointment, and I had to give up on ever having a nickname.</p>
                                             <p>Years later, I was ready to launch my website and begin reading Tarot professionally but didn’t feel comfortable using my real name. So out came “Biddy,” and Biddy Tarot was born!</p>
                                          </div>
                                       </div>
                                    </div>
                                 </div>
                              </div>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                        <div id="fws_5ef418ba77fc8" data-column-margin="default" data-midnight="dark" class="wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-section standard_section fastforward" style="padding-top: 75px; padding-bottom: 75px; ">
                           <div class="row-bg-wrap" data-bg-animation="none" data-bg-overlay="false">
                              <div class="inner-wrap using-image">
                                 <div class="row-bg using-image" style="background-image: url(https://www.biddytarot.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/About_BG-5.jpg); background-position: right center; background-repeat: no-repeat; "></div>
                              </div>
                              <div class="row-bg-overlay"></div>
                           </div>
                           <div class="row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left">
                              <div class="vc_col-sm-12 vc_col-lg-7 vc_col-md-8 vc_col-xs-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone " data-t-w-inherits="default" data-bg-cover="" data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-hover-bg="" data-hover-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0">
                                 <div class="vc_column-inner">
                                    <div class="column-bg-overlay-wrap" data-bg-animation="none">
                                       <div class="column-bg-overlay"></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="wpb_wrapper">
                                       <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
                                          <div class="wpb_wrapper">
                                             <h2 class="center gold bold fs34">Fast Forward to Today&#8230;</h2>
                                          </div>
                                       </div>
                                       <div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  white">
                                          <div class="wpb_wrapper">
                                             <p>Biddy Tarot has blossomed into the leading online learning community for people who read Tarot.</p>
                                             <p>Every year, Biddy Tarot helps over nine million people to read Tarot and is consistently in the top rankings on Google as a trusted source for card meanings and tutorials.</p>
                                             <p>Over 3,500 students have taken part in our online training courses, and we have more than 2,000 members in our Biddy Tarot Community. We employ 20 team members (including my husband) and now generate a very healthy 7-figure revenue each year through our online courses, books, audio programs, and community.</p>
                                             <p style="text-align: center;"><span class="green bold fs22">It seriously blows my mind.</span></p>
                                             <p>Thanks to the success of the Biddy Tarot business, I can spend more time at home with my family, I’ve manifested my dream home on the Sunshine Coast, Australia, we live an abundant lifestyle, and we can travel regularly and take extended breaks to do fun things together.</p>
                                             <p>And we're able to contribute to our favourite, high-impact charities such as One Girl (helping young women in Africa to get an education and start their own business), the Smith Family (sponsoring Australian kids to continue their schooling), and Kiva (providing micro-finance loans to women around the world).</p>
                                             <p style="text-align: center;"><span class="green bold fs22">It is more than I ever could have hoped for.</span></p>
                                             <p>(And if you are called on a similar path of success, I'm now sharing my best business strategies and intuitive wisdom with other creative entrepreneurs in my <a href="">business program</a> and <a href="https://brigitesselmont.com/mentoring/">private 1:1 coaching</a>.)</p>
                                          </div>
                                       </div>
                                    </div>
                                 </div>
                              </div>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                        <div id="fws_5ef418ba78583" data-column-margin="default" data-midnight="dark" class="wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row standard_section " style="padding-top: 50px; padding-bottom: 25px; ">
                           <div class="row-bg-wrap" data-bg-animation="none" data-bg-overlay="false">
                              <div class="inner-wrap">
                                 <div class="row-bg" style=""></div>
                              </div>
